OL,3,GNEWSAUK reservist regiment in overseas 
OL,4,ANato exercise                          
OL,6,FArmy reservists from the south of      
OL,7,FEngland have created a fresh chapter of
OL,8,Fa regiment's military history in the   
OL,9,Fsnow-covered pine forests of Finland.  
OL,11,FOperating in sub-zero temperatures, the
OL,12,Fpart-time volunteer soldiers have been 
OL,13,Ffiring anti-aircraft missiles at flying
OL,14,Ftargets in the regiment's first        
OL,15,Foverseas live-firing exercise.         
OL,17,FAbout 100 reservists from 106th        
OL,18,F(Yeomanry) Regiment Royal Artillery    
OL,19,Fhave been taking part in Nato exercise 
OL,20,FMallet Strike 26.                      
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
