OL,3,GNEWSAUK reservist regiment in overseas 
OL,4,ANato exercise                          
OL,6,FLt Charlie Thisby, who works for HM    
OL,7,FCoastguard in her civilian life, said: 
OL,8,F"For our soldiers coming from the UK,  
OL,9,Fthey've never really operated in these 
OL,10,Fenvironments before."                  
